acro؟ أعتقد الماكرو مش صعب قوي يعني. \n6. الموضوع هيبقى أوتوماتيك، لا أنا هدخل أكتب حاجة بإيدي ولا صاحبي هيدخل يكتب حاجة بإيدي، إحنا عايزين حاجة تشتغل من الألف للياء. \n7. طيب، كده فاضل إيه تاني؟ هنبني السيستم كامل يعني، ولا فاضل إيه؟ \n8. بالنسبة للرفع على السيرفر، مش شرط، أنا ممكن أحط له الويبسايت أو أحط له الأكواد دي كلها على الجهاز وأقول له تعمل كذا. عايز حاجة بسيطة، مثلا يضغط على أيقونة يشتغل البرنامج، مش عايزه يدخل في التيرمينال ويكتب مثلا رن كذا أو يوبيكورن كذا. هو بس أيقونة يضغط عليها يظهر له السيستم، يدروب في المخازن، يدروب في النواقص، ويعمل سبميت. عمل سبميت يبقى في زرار يعرض الإكسيل شيت، وزرار يفتح المكان بتاع الإكسيل شيت. ضغط على الزرار اللي بيفتح الإكسيل شيت هيفتح له الإكسيل شيت، هيبص عليه ويراجع، بعد كده مثلا هيخش على اللي يحتاج مراجعة، هيبص عليه هيراجعه. راجعه، هيقفل الإكسيل شيت،\n<truncated 5141 bytes>\n9. [Artifact comment on file:///c%3A/Users/kakak/.gemini/antigravity/brain/916274de-7f92-49fc-a0a8-d291664b474a/implementation_plan.md]: في كمان حاجة عايز أعملها وهي إعدادات الـ APIs، يعني برضه يبقى ضايف إعدادات عشان تضيف الـ APIs بتاعة مثلا الـ unstructured.io API والموديل، سواء بقى الموديل بقى هيبقى فيه Providers أو يبقى Local زي اللي احنا مستخدمينه الـ MES أو الـ MSE ده، الـ MSE Max. وبرضه أنا هبعت له أو أنا هنقل معاه سيرفر الـ MS Max على جهاز صاحبي، فعايز مثلا برضه زرار أتك عليه يوديني يفتح لي كده Window جديدة كده، الزرار أول حاجة اللي هو Set up requirements تمام وجنبيه صح، يبقى أنا كده ثبت الـ requirements. تاني حاجه تثبيت الـ وخلي بالك برضه في تثبيت الـ requirements اللي\n<truncated 2410 bytes>\n10. وخلي بالك كنت أنا اللي برفع ملفات الـ PDF على unstructured.io وأبعت لك الملفات بعد ما أنزلها من الموقع. خلي بالك دي هتبقى عملية أوتوماتيكية، والملف لما أنت تبعت له API، هتضطر الملف تحمله على الجهاز. خلي بالك يعني أنت الحتة دي برضه عشان ما تبقاش ناسيها، عشان ما تفكرش إن صاحبي هيبعت لك الملف متظبط ومتفيّم وكل حاجة، لا. \n\n# Previous Session Summary:\n# Continuation Summary — Pharmacy Matcher Desktop App\n\n## 1. Outstanding User Requests\n\n### Request A: Build the Desktop Application (Status: IMPLEMENTATION — IN PROGRESS)\nThe user wants a **complete Desktop Application** (EXE-ready) that wraps the existing pharmacy drug matching engine. Key requirements from the user's own words:\n\n- **\"عايز حاجة بسيطة، مثلا يضغط على أيقونة يشتغل البرنامج، مش عايزه يدخل في التيرمينال\"** — No Terminal visible, ever.\n- **\"عايز تحول الأبليكيشن EXE\"** — Package as .exe\n- **\"Setup هيثبت الـ Requirements، هيطلع له أيقونة على الـ Desktop\"** — One-click installer\n- **Screens requested**: Home (New/History/Settings/Exit), New Process (drag files + submit), Results (open Excel/open folder/apply reviews/back), History (browse old processes by ID), Settings (API keys + MSEMAX server management)\n- **Review workflow**: Excel dropdown with ✅/❌. Empty = stays in review. \"تنفيذ التعديلات\" button can be pressed multiple times safely. **\"أهم حاجة اللي جنبيها علامة يتحذف من المراجعة، واللي ما جنبيهوش علامة يفضل ثابت\"**\n- **History**: Each process gets an ID, all input/output files preserved, can revisit and continue reviewing\n- **MSEMAX Server Management in Settings**: Setup Requirements button (pip install + playwright install), Get Session button (runs get_session.py), Start/Stop Server button. Also a quick Start/Stop server toggle on the main Home screen. **\"لما يقفل الـ Application كل حاجه الـ Process بتحصل لها Kill\"**\n- **App name**: \"Pharmacy Matcher\" approved by user\n\n### Request B: PDF Processing Must Be Fully Automatic (Status: IMPLEMENTATION — needs verification)\nUser explicitly warned: **\"خلي بالك كنت أنا اللي برفع ملفات الـ PDF على unstructured.io وأبعت لك الملفات... خلي بالك دي هتبقى عملية أوتوماتيكية\"** — The user was manually uploading PDFs to Unstructured.io before. Now the app must handle the full pipeline: user drops raw PDF → app sends to Unstructured API → receives parsed data → matches → outputs Excel. The existing `src/extract/pdf_reader.py` and `file_handler.py` already support this flow, but the backend.py `start_process()` MUST pass `api_key` from settings to `read_input_files()`.\n\n### Request C: Deploy to Vercel (Status: NOT STARTED / DEFERRED)\nLong-term goal mentioned early in conversation. User later pivoted to local Desktop app instead: **\"بالنسبة للرفع على السيرفر، مش شرط\"**. This is effectively deprioritized.\n\n---\n\n## 2. User Knowledge\n\n### API Keys & Credentials\n- **OpenRouter API Key** (now deprecated for this project): `[REDACTED_CREDENTIAL]`\n- **MSEMAX API Key** (from `D:\\AI_Engineer\\MSEMAX\\.env`): `[REDACTED_CREDENTIAL]`\n- **Unstructured.io API Key**: stored in project `.env` file at `d:\\AI_Engineer\\Pharmacy-agy\\.env`\n\n### MSEMAX Server Details\n- Located at: `D:\\AI_Engineer\\MSEMAX\\`\n- Runs on: `http://127.0.0.1:8000` (FastAPI + Uvicorn)\n- Rate limit: 10/minute, Max concurrent: 3\n- Entry: `python app.py` in that directory\n- Session capture: `python get_session.py` (opens browser, interactive)\n- Requirements: fastapi, uvicorn, curl-cffi, playwright, pydantic, slowapi, python-dotenv\n- **User will copy both the project AND MSEMAX folder to friend's machine**: \"انا هنقل المشروع بتاعك... وهنقل برضه السيرفر بتاع ال ام اس اي ده\"\n\n### User Preferences\n- Everything must be fully automatic, zero manual steps for the end user (friend)\n- Arabic UI, RTL layout\n- The friend should never see a Terminal\n- Current approach uses local MSEMAX (ChatGPT wrapper) instead of OpenRouter (rate-limited) or Gemini (quota-limited)\n\n---\n\n## 3. Work Accomplished\n\n### Phase 1: Core Matching Engine (COMPLETED)\n- **OpenRouter Integration** in `src/match/coordinator.py`: Migrated from Google GenAI SDK to OpenRouter REST API with regex JSON parsing and ThreadPoolExecutor.\n- **Fast Hybrid Engine** in `src/fast_match/`: Built TF-IDF character n-gram search (`search.py`) + LLM validation (`coordinator.py`). Uses 3-tier filtering:\n  - Score ≥ 0.85 → Auto-match (no API call)\n  - Score 0.35–0.85 → Send to LLM (only ~126-194 items instead of 591)\n  - Score < 0.35 → Auto-reject\n- **MSEMAX Local API Integration**: Updated `src/fast_match/coordinator.py` to call `http://127.0.0.1:8000/v1/chat/completions` with proper API key auth, 2 workers, 6.5s pacing.\n- **Verified working**: Successfully processed 993 shortages × 207 warehouse items. Result: 23 matched, 1 TF-IDF auto-match, 19 review. Saved to `output/results_fast.xlsx`.\n\n### Phase 2: Excel Review System (COMPLETED)\n- Added dropdown column \"القرار (اختر)\" with Data Validation (`✅ مطابق` / `❌ غير مطابق`) to the \"يحتاج مراجعة\" sheet in `src/output/excel_writer.py`.\n- Created `finalize.py` script that reads Excel, processes marked rows (moves ✅ to warehouse sheet, ❌ to not-found), deletes processed rows, leaves unmarked rows intact.\n\n### Phase 3: Desktop App (IN PROGRESS — ~60% done)\n**Two subagents were launched to build in parallel:**\n\n1. **Backend Python builder** (conversation `78556a8d-8b4e-4647-a699-1929cb9e3e1a`) — Status: **STILL RUNNING** at checkpoint time. Building:\n   - `desktop_app/database.py` — SQLite history manager\n   - `desktop_app/server_manager.py` — MSEMAX subprocess manager\n   - `desktop_app/backend.py` — Python API class for pywebview\n   - `desktop_app/__init__.py`\n\n2. **Frontend UI builder** (conversation `90761d3d-59f2-4ed1-92bf-a470ccfdb240`) — Status: **COMPLETED**. Created:\n   - `desktop_app/templates/index.html` — Full SPA with 5 screens\n   - `desktop_app/static/style.css` — RTL professional styling with Cairo font\n   - `desktop_app/static/app.js` — Frontend logic with pywebview API calls\n\n**Files I created directly:**\n- `desktop_app/app.py` — pywebview entry point (creates window, wires API, handles close event)\n- `setup.bat` — One-click installer (creates venv, installs requirements, creates Desktop shortcut via VBS)\n- `run.bat` — Silent launcher using `pythonw.exe` (no Terminal)\n\n---\n\n## 4. Model Knowledge\n\n### Architecture\n- **pywebview** is the desktop framework: creates a native window, renders HTML/CSS/JS, exposes Python class methods to JS via `js_api` parameter. JS calls `window.pywebview.api.method_name()`.\n- **File selection in pywebview**: Standard `<input type=\"file\">` does NOT give full paths. Must use `pywebview`'s `window.create_file_dialog()` or expose a backend method `select_files()` that opens native dialog. The frontend subagent was told to use `pywebview.api.select_files(type)` approach.\n- **SQLite** is used for history (`data/history.db`). Process files stored in `data/processes/PROC-XXX/{input_shortages, input_warehouses, output}`.\n- The `src/config.py` Config dataclass currently has: `local_api_url`, `local_api_key`, `local_model`, `unstructured_api_key`, `unstructured_base_url`, `gemini_model`, `gemini_api_key`.\n- The `backend.py` start_process() must temporarily override config values with user settings from `data/settings.json` before running the pipeline.\n\n### Critical Failures & Constraints\n- **OpenRouter free tier**: Completely unusable. HTTP 429 on every request even with 2 workers and exponential backoff. The free tier has an extremely aggressive per-second rate limit that blocks bulk operations.\n- **Gemini API**: 20 requests/day limit on free tier. Unusable for 591+ items.\n- **Generic open-source models** (via OpenRouter `openrouter/free`): Cannot follow compressed JSON schemas. Need human-readable keys (`status`, `match`, `case_id`) and robust regex extraction `re.search(r'\\{.*\\}', content, re.DOTALL)`.\n- **Batch size for generic models**: Must be ≤50. Larger batches cause models to lose context and return 0 matches.\n- **Windows CREATE_NO_WINDOW**: Use `0x08000000` flag with `subprocess.Popen` to hide Terminal when starting MSEMAX server.\n- **`pythonw.exe`** (not `python.exe`) must be used in `run.bat` to suppress the console window entirely.\n\n### MSEMAX Integration Details\n- Server requires POW (Proof of Work) solving before each request\n- `get_session.py` opens a browser (Playwright/Chromium) for user to log into ChatGPT and capture cookies → saves to `session_data.json`\n- The `.env` file key `MSE_MAX_KEY` is what goes in the `Authorization: Bearer <key>` header\n- Server command: `python app.py` in the MSEMAX directory (uses uvicorn internally)\n\n---\n\n## 5. Files and Code\n\n### Edited/Created Files\n\n| File | What Changed | Why |\n|------|-------------|-----|\n| `d:\\AI_Engineer\\Pharmacy-agy\\src\\config.py` | Added `local_api_url`, `local_api_key`, `local_model` fields; removed OpenRouter fields | Switch from OpenRouter to local MSEMAX API |\n| `d:\\AI_Engineer\\Pharmacy-agy\\src\\fast_match\\__init__.py` | Created (empty) | Package init |\n| `d:\\AI_Engineer\\Pharmacy-agy\\src\\fast_match\\search.py` | Created — TF-IDF char n-gram vectorizer + cosine similarity search | Fast local candidate finding |\n| `d:\\AI_Engineer\\Pharmacy-agy\\src\\fast_match\\coordinator.py` | Created — Full pipeline: dedup → exact match → TF-IDF auto-match/reject → LLM batches. Uses `_call_local_api()` with MSEMAX endpoint, 2 workers, 6.5s pacing | The hybrid matching engine |\n| `d:\\AI_Engineer\\Pharmacy-agy\\fast_main.py` | Created — CLI entry point for fast engine | Testing the fast engine from terminal |\n| `d:\\AI_Engineer\\Pharmacy-agy\\src\\output\\excel_writer.py` | Added \"القرار (اختر)\" column with DataValidation dropdown to \"يحتاج مراجعة\" sheet (lines ~202-240) | Enable pharmacist review workflow |\n| `d:\\AI_Engineer\\Pharmacy-agy\\finalize.py` | Created — Reads Excel, processes ✅/❌ rows, moves them, saves | Post-review automation |\n| `d:\\AI_Engineer\\Pharmacy-agy\\vba_macro.txt` | Created but **NOT USED** — user rejected VBA approach | User wanted fully automatic solution |\n| `d:\\AI_Engineer\\Pharmacy-agy\\desktop_app\\app.py` | Created — pywebview entry point | Desktop app launcher |\n| `d:\\AI_Engineer\\Pharmacy-agy\\setup.bat` | Created — venv + pip install + desktop shortcut | One-click installer |\n| `d:\\AI_Engineer\\Pharmacy-agy\\run.bat` |